   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-09-09",
   "text": "Nationwide Right To Unionize Act\n This bill provides authorization for labor agreements to require membership in a labor organization as a condition of employment regardless of state law (thus preempting state laws that prohibit such agreements)."
